Third-party data notice

This project does not host or own any phone numbers or SMS content. At runtime
it fetches publicly displayed pages from third-party websites and parses them.
All numbers, messages and related content remain the property of their
respective sources and their owners:

  - receive-sms.cc
  - freephonenum.com

The names, trademarks and page content of these websites belong to their
respective owners and are used here only to locate publicly available data.
The MIT license above applies solely to the source code in this repository,
not to any data retrieved from third-party sites.

Use this software at your own risk and only in ways that comply with the terms
of service and robots policy of each source website, and with all laws that
apply to you. See the "Legal and responsible use" section of README.md.
